label "Mode 3, evolutive skills: Procedures export to SKILL.md packs (highlighted), packs install into an agent's tool tree, and an improved skill comes back as a Procedure through import"
caption "The highlighted packs are content only; the dashed return is how a skill improved in the field becomes a Procedure again."
box proc 16 100 120 50 "Procedures|(steps + checks)"
box pack 170 100 120 50 "SKILL.md packs" acc
box tree 324 100 120 50 "agent tool tree|(.claude/skills…)"
arrow proc pack
arrow pack tree
arrow tree proc dashed via=384,190;76,190
text 230 204 "an improved skill comes back as a Procedure"
note "packs are content only: no scripts, no executables, a lockfile of hashes"
